{"id":"n59725-2-7","stage":0,"title":"부자 · 富翁","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59725-2-7-1","ko":"우리는 형제가 딸만 다섯이야.","zh":"我们家有五个孩子，全是女儿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리는","meaning":"我们家","explanation":"우리：这里指自己的家庭；-는 标记话题。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"3","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리는","audio":"/audio/6cae49a92f8e0e0e2ffd.mp3"}},{"text":"형제가","meaning":"兄弟姐妹","explanation":"형제：兄弟姐妹；-가 标记主语，这里说明兄弟姐妹共有五个。","readings":[{"term":"형제","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73223","senseId":"2","lemma":"형제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형제가","audio":"/audio/9104a3e05ed27f8c334f.mp3"}},{"text":"딸만","meaning":"全是女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；-만 表示“只有”，即五个孩子都是女儿。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"딸만","audio":"/audio/734974f2c4c5a0e30f94.mp3"}},{"text":"다섯이야.","meaning":"有五个","explanation":"다섯：五；-이야 是非敬语判断句末。","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다섯이야","audio":"/audio/700d567525972fe99a58.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们家","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"这里亲切地指说话人自己的家庭。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"6d2b6b10fa368657","term":"형제","zh":"兄弟姐妹；本句指五个姐妹","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3","entryId":"73223","definition":"同一对父母的子女；这里指五个姐妹。","pronunciation":["형제"]},{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"0d616c5afd